{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/BinaryParsing\/documentation\/BinaryParsing","doc:\/\/BinaryParsing\/documentation\/BinaryParsing\/ParserSpan"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/BinaryParsing\/documentation\/BinaryParsing\/ParserSpan\/seek(toOffsetFromEnd:)"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Seeking to a Relative Offset","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinaryParsing\/documentation\/BinaryParsing\/ParserSpan\/seek(toRelativeOffset:)","doc:\/\/BinaryParsing\/documentation\/BinaryParsing\/ParserSpan\/seeking(toRelativeOffset:)","doc:\/\/BinaryParsing\/documentation\/BinaryParsing\/ParserSpan\/seeking(toOffsetFromEnd:)"],"anchor":"Seeking-to-a-Relative-Offset"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/binaryparsing\/parserspan\/seek(tooffsetfromend:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"seek"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"toOffsetFromEnd"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"offset"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FixedWidthInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s17FixedWidthIntegerP"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ParsingError","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/BinaryParsing\/documentation\/BinaryParsing\/ParsingError","preciseIdentifier":"s:13BinaryParsing0B5ErrorV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The number of bytes to move backward from the end of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"